; AdminModDW localized strings.
;
; AdminModDW adds no weapons, classes or UI, so there is nothing to localise -- but the
; cooker copies Development\Src\<Mod>\Localization unconditionally and fails the build
; if the folder is missing, so this file exists to satisfy that step.
;
; Sections here are [ClassName] with one Key=Value per var localized on that class.

[ChatMessages]
